   "speaker": "a",
   "scene": "map_today",
   "date": "AD 117",
   "text": "In AD 117, one empire ran from Britain to Iraq, about five million square kilometres. Today, that land is split among more than thirty countries.",
   "say": "In A D one seventeen, one empire ran from Britain to Iraq, about five million square kilometres. Today, that land is split among more than thirty countries."
