  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "North of the Danube, in Dacia, today's Romania. He fought two wars there, from 101 to 106, and built a bridge over a kilometre long to cross the river.",
   "say": "North of the Danube, in Dacia, today's Romania. He fought two wars there, from one-oh-one to one-oh-six, and built a bridge over a kilometre long to cross the river."
